00:26:32.610 --> 00:26:33.060
MELANIE WARRICK:
It's very helpful.

00:26:33.060 --> 00:26:33.590
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:26:33.590 --> 00:26:34.700
I want to give the
short answer here

00:26:34.700 --> 00:26:37.460
but I'm going to put a lot of
resources in the show notes

00:26:37.460 --> 00:26:39.980
because there's a
